{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52195","headline":"颂六十二首 二十 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 二十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高堂信逆旅，怀（一作「坏」）业理常牵。\n玉匣方委观，金台不复延。\n挽声随径远，萝影带松悬。\n讵能留十念，唯应逐四缘。\n幻工作同异，变弄巧（一作「作」）多声（一作「身」）。\n愚俗诤人我，谁复非谓真。\n谬者疑久固，达者知幻宾。\n陞沉苦乐异，徒祭哭苍天（一作「亲疎既无定，何劳非苍旻」。\n）（见同书卷十九《送终部》。\n注一作者，爲《法苑珠林》卷一百十六之异文。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52195.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52195","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}